           MOVE "14-"          TO NUM-14.
           MOVE OUT-DCODE      TO CODE-14.

           ADD 1               TO ACT-KEY.
           READ OUT-FILE INVALID KEY
               MOVE 1          TO EOF-SW
               GO TO FS-EXIT.
           IF ACT-KEY > MAX-KEY
