               GO TO FS-EXIT.
           MOVE "24-"          TO NUM-24.
           MOVE OUT-DCODE      TO CODE-24.

           ADD 1               TO ACT-KEY.
           READ OUT-FILE INVALID KEY
               MOVE 1          TO EOF-SW
